{
  "id": "3xo478k",
  "title": "Chapter 5: Gupta Empire",
  "order": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "t7ff1vp",
      "content": "The Gupta Empire is known as the 'Golden Age of Ancient India'. It witnessed great achievements in administration, science, literature, art, and culture."
    },
    {
      "type": "statStrip",
      "stats": [
        {
          "label": "Samudragupta Reign",
          "value": "335–375 CE",
          "icon": "calendar"
        },
        {
          "label": "Chandragupta II Reign",
          "value": "380–415 CE",
          "icon": "clock"
        },
        {
          "label": "Notable Title",
          "value": "Vikramaditya",
          "icon": "award"
        }
      ],
      "id": "5apjznd"
    },
    {
      "id": "5jk033j",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Rise of the Gupta Empire"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Samudragupta ruled the Gupta Empire from 335 to 375 CE.",
        "Chandragupta II, also known as Vikramaditya, ruled from 380 to 415 CE.",
        "The Gupta period saw significant developments across administration, economy, art, architecture, science, and technology.",
        "Literature and education reached prominent heights during this era before its eventual decline."
      ],
      "id": "5gqbyx3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "exuiw17",
      "content": "• The Gupta Empire was founded by Sri Gupta around 240 CE."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "glfzjpd",
      "content": "• The Guptas initially ruled a small kingdom in eastern Uttar Pradesh and Bihar."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ltc21v9",
      "content": "• The real expansion of the empire started with Chandragupta I."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0zt0bkf",
      "content": "• Chandragupta I assumed the title 'Maharajadhiraja'."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ejzrj6g",
      "content": "• His marriage with Lichchhavi princess Kumaradevi strengthened the Gupta power."
    },
    {
      "id": "by405a5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
